342: ## Technical Approach
343: 
344: ### Grid Factory Pattern
345: ```csharp
346: public static class GridFactory
347: {
348:     public static IGrid CreateGrid(Marker marker, int width, int height)
349:     {
350:         return marker switch
351:         {
352:             Marker.Braille => new BrailleGrid(width, height),
353:             Marker.HalfBlock => new HalfBlockGrid(width, height),
354:             Marker.Dot => new CharGrid(width, height, '•'),
355:             Marker.Block => new CharGrid(width, height, '█'),
356:             Marker.Bar => new CharGrid(width, height, '▄'),
357:             _ => throw new ArgumentException($"Unsupported marker: {marker}")
358:         };
359:     }
360: }
361: ```
362: 
363: ### Unicode Pattern Handling
364: ```csharp
365: internal static class BraillePatterns
366: {
367:     private const ushort BRAILLE_BLANK = 0x2800;
368:     
369:     // 2x4 dot pattern masks
370:     private static readonly ushort[,] DotMasks = new ushort[4, 2]
371:     {
372:         { 0x01, 0x08 }, // Row 0: dots 1, 4
373:         { 0x02, 0x10 }, // Row 1: dots 2, 5  
374:         { 0x04, 0x20 }, // Row 2: dots 3, 6
375:         { 0x40, 0x80 }  // Row 3: dots 7, 8
376:     };
377:     
378:     public static ushort GetPattern(int x, int y)
379:     {
380:         return DotMasks[y % 4, x % 2];
381:     }
382: }
383: ```
384: 
385: ### Performance Optimizations
386: - **Bounds Checking**: Early rejection of out-of-bounds coordinates
387: - **Memory Pooling**: Reuse grid instances where possible
388: - **Lazy Evaluation**: Defer layer rendering until final output
389: - **Efficient Unicode**: Direct UTF-16 manipulation for Braille patterns
