453: ## Examples
454: 
455: ### Basic Canvas Usage
456: ```csharp
457: var canvas = new Canvas<Action<ICanvasContext>>()
458:     .WithXBounds(-10.0, 10.0)
459:     .WithYBounds(-5.0, 5.0)
460:     .WithMarker(Marker.Braille)
461:     .Paint(ctx =>
462:     {
463:         ctx.Draw(new Line { X1 = -5, Y1 = 0, X2 = 5, Y2 = 0, Color = Color.White });
464:         ctx.Draw(new Circle { X = 0, Y = 0, Radius = 3, Color = Color.Red });
465:         ctx.PrintText(0, -4, "Origin");
466:     });
467: ```
468: 
